OL,3,GNEWSAStudent stabbed housemate 30 times
OL,4,Ain masked ambush
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university student lay in wait for
OL,7,Fhis housemate before stabbing him 30
OL,8,Ftimes, in what the prosecution describe
OL,9,Fas a "carefully planned and
OL,10,Fcold-blooded execution".
OL,12,FZack Coughlan, 23, dressed in black and
OL,13,Fwore a mask to ambush Jamie Collins,
OL,14,F21, in the garden of their home in
OL,15,FFilton, near Bristol, on 8 April.
OL,17,FThe trial at Bristol Crown Court was
OL,18,Ftold earlier how Coughlan left Collins
OL,19,Fdying in the alleyway as he cycled away
OL,20,Fon Collins' bike to dispose of his
OL,21,Fbloodstained evidence.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
